  "description": "Conversion of a semi-detached dwellinghouse into 5 flats. Extensions include, Two storey side/rear extension (following demolition of existing); single storey side /rear (wrap around) extension (254125HH); Single storey (Max 6m deep and Max 3m high) rear extension(application number 253413PALHE); Alteration of roof from hip to gable end and roof extension to rear (main) roof slope incorporating a Juliet balcony; and installation of three roof lights to front roofslope (application number 253414CPL) to the full width of the plot, replacement of the existing outbuilding (shed) and boundary wall to the side of the house, with a pitched roof 2 storey side / rear extension, a new porch extension to the existing entrance and the sub-division of the rear garden including provision of cycle, refuse/ recycling storage and amenity spaces to the front and rear of the plot.",
